{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 32,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        145.3711700439453,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "Contact clinical evaluation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        54.273040771484375,
        399.6927795410156,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "A systematic process for the diagnosis or exclusion of active TB among contacts. Clinical",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        66.27005004882812,
        399.6749267578125,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "evaluation is undertaken if the results of contact identiﬁcation and prioritization indicate a",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51020431518555,
        78.26705932617188,
        399.7379455566406,
        87.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "risk for having or developing TB. For the purposes of these recommendations, the deﬁnition of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57320785522461,
        90.26406860351562,
        399.8731994628906,
        99.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "contact clinical evaluation includes, at a minimum, a more extensive assessment of symptoms",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.6992073059082,
        102.26107788085938,
        263.0964660644531,
        111.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "compatible with TB. Additional components may include:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52450180053711,
        120.27603149414062,
        176.37252807617188,
        129.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• a more detailed medical history,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.533504486083984,
        138.27603149414062,
        143.91851806640625,
        147.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• a physical examination,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54250717163086,
        156.27603149414062,
        355.9764709472656,
        165.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• microbiological assessment of specimens from sites of suspected involvement,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.551509857177734,
        174.27603149414062,
        172.115478515625,
        183.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• radiographic examinations and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.56051254272461,
        192.27603149414062,
        148.9945526123047,
        201.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• invasive diagnostic tests.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.569515228271484,
        210.27603149414062,
        399.7701721191406,
        219.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Implementation of these components will depend on the clinical circumstances and the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.60551834106445,
        222.27304077148438,
        400.1393737792969,
        231.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "available resources. In addition, depending on the epidemiological circumstances and resources,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53353500366211,
        234.27005004882812,
        399.71331787109375,
        243.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "a tuberculin skin test or an interferon gamma release assay for LTBI may be part of the clinical",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5394172668457,
        246.27008056640625,
        85.45143127441406,
        255.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "evaluation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5394172668457,
        264.27008056640625,
        71.93341064453125,
        273.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        276.27606201171875,
        399.82794189453125,
        285.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "The goal of contact investigation is to ﬁnd previously undiagnosed cases of active TB. The goal",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.6631965637207,
        288.2730712890625,
        399.8818054199219,
        297.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "of clinical evaluation is to diagnose or exclude TB and, in some situations, to identify and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.71719741821289,
        300.27008056640625,
        399.8729248046875,
        309.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "possibly treat LTBI. The approaches used depend on resources and circumstances; however, in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.69919967651367,
        312.26708984375,
        399.908935546875,
        321.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "all situations, contacts should be interviewed to determine whether they have symptoms",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.73520278930664,
        324.26409912109375,
        388.72723388671875,
        333.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "consistent with TB, and they should be further evaluated if symptoms are present (29–31).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.0893096923828,
        651.97265625,
        225.12181091308594,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "30",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}